# Steam bot sidecar — local ignores.
#
# The repo-root .gitignore already ignores `.env`, `*.env`, and `.env.*`
# globally. That last pattern also swallows `.env.example`, which we WANT
# tracked. Re-include ONLY that one template file here. We do NOT re-state the
# ignore patterns (doing so alongside the negation caused git to mis-resolve and
# un-ignore real secrets) — the root rules keep every real .env file ignored.

!.env.example
